The stakeholder groups consulted comprised of:
1. Individuals and focus groups within the affected people (149);
2. Community-representing organisations (28);
3. Community-facing and coordination/management field-level positions within WFP, cooperating partners, interagency bodies and other partners in the response community (37);
4. WFP and cooperating partner leadership (11);
5. AAP global flagship bodies (13);
6. Donors (3).
i. Pre-consultation interviews (21);
